pport-next-phase-of-growth/","evidence":"Power Factors, a leading software, services and hardware provider for renewable energy management, today announced a new minority investment from Mubadala Investment Company (“Mubadala”), an Abu Dhabi-based global investor. Mubadala will join existing investor Vista Equity Partners (“Vista”) as a significant minority investor supporting Power Factors’ continued growth, innovation, and global expansion.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:3130ec53c4da16c19996779904c3e388","date":"2026-03-05","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Portside","portco_name":"Portside","target_website":"portside.co","investor":"Vista Equity Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Portside Announces New Investment from Vista Equity Partners and Names Brandon Holden as Next Chief Executive Officer","summary":"Aviation software provider Portside received a further investment from Vista, which first invested in 2024; Insight Partners remains a significant shareholder.","source_name":"Vista Equity Partners","source_url":"https://www.vistaequitypartners.com/news/portside-announces-new-investment-from-vista-equity-partners/","evidence":"Portside , a leading provider of modern, cloud-based software solutions for global aviation, today announced a new investment from Vista Equity Partners (“Vista”), a global technology investor that specializes in enterprise software. ... Current investor Insight Partners will remain a significant shareholder in Portside.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:5ddfe8f5b30c878b28fc84cb352cfaef","date":"2026-01-15","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"StarRez","portco_name":"StarRez","target_website":"starrez.com","investor":"Five Arrows","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"