ss to the world's most extensive network of fitness and wellness experiences.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:b48fa0ce661e24f00ad7b7fe1878826d","date":"2021-10-13","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Mindbody","portco_name":"Mindbody","target_website":"mindbodyonline.com","investor":"Sixth Street","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":500000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Leading Wellness Experience Platform Mindbody to Acquire ClassPass; Announces $500 Million Strategic Investment","summary":"Alongside its ClassPass acquisition, Mindbody secured a $500 million strategic investment from a group led by Sixth Street, with Vista remaining majority investor.","source_name":"PR Newswire","source_url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/leading-wellness-experience-platform-mindbody-to-acquire-classpass-announces-500-million-strategic-investment-301398685.html","evidence":"In conjunction with the acquisition, Mindbody has secured a strategic investment of $500 million from a group led by Sixth Street, a leading global investment firm. ... This investment, together with the continued support of Mindbody's majority investor and partner, Vista Equity Partners","verified":true},{"key":"pr:538c26eb439a4bb840617da5c70912e6","date":"2020-03-04","date_text":null,"kind":"add_on_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"ZeeZor","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"MINDBODY, Inc.","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Mindbody Acquires ZeeZor","summary":"Mindbody acquired ZeeZor, a staff analytics and engagement platform for salons and spas.","source_name":"PR Newswire","source